  "abstract": {
    "value": "The reaction of c-stannylated propargyl esters in the presence of a cationic gold( ) catalyst afords vinylidenecyclopropane derivatives as a mixture of diastereomers. The cis-geometry of the alkenes is almost entirely retained in the product. DFT calculations suggest the involvement of the gold(I)-stabilized propargyl cation as a resonance form of gold(I)-coordinated allenylidene species.",
